{"id":134048975793062,"name":"Final Nerve Obby","desc":"Are you ready for Final Nerve Obby? An electrifying obby adventure with a whopping 180 total stages of ascending difficulty! Can you rise above the challenge and emerge as the undisputed Obby Master? Not even 1% will complete this, Good luck..\n\nCONTROLS (Computer, Console):\n- Reset Character (R, Y)\n- Shift Lock (Shift, LT)\n\nTags: obby, adventure, difficulty chart, parkour, rage, hard, fun, challenging, tower, towers, impossible, insane, intense, unbeatable, wraparound, master, obstacle course, extreme, difficult, win, cry.","path":"/game/134048975793062-final-nerve-obby","slug":"134048975793062-final-nerve-obby","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/60bcb64fa9e39bb0bce90afda393befcc10cbcbb833df1a9ac76bcbc958d7fb5.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f032804f75c78c560caebef2c963dcca/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":16,"visitor":2442680,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-07T22:59:08.665Z","creator":{"name":"-Hardcore Obbies-","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Final-Nerve-Obby-Simple-Checkpoint-Teleporter-212704","_id":"69fd193c255dc895a9ee5136","title":"Simple Checkpoint Teleporter","game":{"_id":"69fd193c255dc895a9ee5133","gameId":134048975793062,"name":"Final Nerve Obby","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":134048975793062},"features":"Teleports you through every checkpoint from 1 to 180\n0.3 second delay between each teleport\nAutomatically deletes itself when finished","tags":[],"script":"local checkpoints = workspace.Checkpoints\nlocal player = game.Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal char = player.Character or player.CharacterAdded:Wait()\nlocal root = char:WaitForChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n\nfor i = 1, 180 do\n\tlocal cp = checkpoints:FindFirstChild(tostring(i))\n\tif cp then\n\t\troot.CFrame = cp.CFrame + Vector3.new(0, 3, 0)\n\tend\n\ttask.wait(0.3)\nend\n\nscript:Destroy()","owner":{"_id":"67feabf9b5e1e2a41ee4c7c7","username":"Koxy","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/6fac52f7bafd633dfad42c6aaa05a3d4de3b960e7f7334ca0610f61e249a4aec.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67feabf9b5e1e2a41ee4c7c7-1778194962669.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"67feabf9b5e1e2a41ee4c7c7","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/6fac52f7bafd633dfad42c6aaa05a3d4de3b960e7f7334ca0610f61e249a4aec.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67feabf9b5e1e2a41ee4c7c7-1778194962669.jpg"}},"verified":false,"views":736,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/774eb3c4656189a8509bd17f0ab5c44583add44f33d4d971a78d63581796481d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-fb4a4821277c92c87e5a7d563bac8420-3460d1cd20c7.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-fb4a4821277c92c87e5a7d563bac8420-3460d1cd20c7.png"},"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-05-07T22:59:08.668Z","executes":48,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-16T02:16:43.518Z","last":"","win":14,"math":2},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/774eb3c4656189a8509bd17f0ab5c44583add44f33d4d971a78d63581796481d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-fb4a4821277c92c87e5a7d563bac8420-3460d1cd20c7.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-fb4a4821277c92c87e5a7d563bac8420-3460d1cd20c7.png"},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69fd193c255dc895a9ee5139","editBy":{"_id":"67feabf9b5e1e2a41ee4c7c7","username":"Koxy","status":"offline","id":"67feab